説明
This answer is correct. Azure Firewall Manager allows you to convert a Virtual WAN virtual hub into a secured virtual hub by deploying Azure Firewall directly in the hub, and routing intent lets you centrally direct both internet and private (branch-to-branch) traffic through the firewall for inspection without manually configuring route tables on every connection.
