Securing an Azure Virtual WAN deployment centrally is achieved by converting virtual hubs into secured virtual hubs using Azure Firewall Manager, then applying routing intent so both internet and private traffic are automatically routed through Azure Firewall for inspection. This native integration eliminates the need for manual route table management and provides a single pane of glass for security policy administration across all hubs.
